      "content": "hey so i was reading about those new smart sneakers from [Brand Name] and some stuff started to feel really off. like, they track your gait and heart rate through the sole, right? i was thinking about how much data that actually is. do u think there's any chance a company would use that kind of biometric stuff to build profiles on people's mental states? like, is there any evidence of that kind of thing happening? it just feels way too invasive.",
